0..76 Comment "// The higher-cells subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported"
77..150 Comment "// by every source that reads them (`import \"./magma-base.gandr\" ;`): the"
151..224 Comment "// magma signature whose two corollas `ua` reads, and the translators its"
225..301 Comment "// models\' tables are given by — the swap of the booleans, the identity on"
302..377 Comment "// them, and the identity on the unit\'s one injection. A `ua[n, k]` path is"
378..453 Comment "// derived degree by degree over the signature\'s matching objects (Shulman,"
454..515 Comment "// _Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity_,"
516..550 Comment "// doi:10.1017/S0960129514000565)."
